      "text": "```\n┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                      LEGAL SYSTEM MAP                                    │\n├─────────────────────────┬────────────────────────┬───────────────────────┤\n│   COMMON LAW            │    CIVIL LAW            │   RELIGIOUS/MIXED     │\n│   (UK, US, Australia,   │    (Continental Europe, │   (Saudi, Israel,     │\n│   Canada, India)        │    Latin America, Japan)│    India personal law) │\n│                         │                         │                       │\n│   Judge-made precedent  │    Codified statutes    │   Religious text +     │\n│   Stare decisis         │    Comprehensive codes  │   secular overlay      │\n│   Adversarial system    │    Inquisitorial system │                       │\n│   Jury trials           │    No jury in civil     │                       │\n│   Equity jurisdiction   │    Judge as investigator│                       │\n└─────────────────────────┴────────────────────────┴───────────────────────┘"
    },
